<task id="_Toc187970778" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Add a motor to an unpaired</title>
   <shortdesc>This section describes how to add motor details to a previously commissioned .</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>motor</keyword>
        <keyword>unpaired</keyword>
        <keyword>section</keyword>
        <keyword>details</keyword>
        <keyword>Unpaired</keyword>
        <keyword>Devices</keyword>
        <indexterm>motor</indexterm>
        <indexterm>unpaired</indexterm>
        <indexterm>section</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>This section describes how to add motor details to a previously commissioned .</p>
         <p>After commissioning an , the  allows you to add motor details at a later stage.</p>
         <p>To add a new motor:</p>
      </context>
      <steps id="steps_10132672">
         <step>
            <cmd>Do one of the following:</cmd>
            <info>
               <ul id="ul_10132670">
                  <li>Tap <b>Dashboard</b> and tap <b>Add new SMS device</b>. The Unpaired SMS Devices screen is displayed.</li>
               </ul>
               <p>or</p>
               <ul id="ul_10132671">
                  <li>Tap <b>Motors</b> and select the <b>Pair SMS Device</b> section at the top of the screen. The Unpaired SMS Devices screen is displayed.</li>
               </ul>
               <fig>
                  <title>Dashboard and Motors screens</title>
                  <image height="350" href="../media/image30.png" placement="break" width="348">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Tap one of the unpaired devices in the list to add a motor to it.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
      <result>
         <p>This will start the motor creation process described in the <xref href="../installation/enter_motor_details.dita" format="dita">Enter motor details</xref> section.</p>
         <p>
            <fig>
               <title>Unpaired SMS Devices list</title>
               <image height="430" href="../media/image31.png" placement="break" width="200">
                  <alt>placeholder</alt>
               </image>
            </fig>
         </p>
      </result>
   </taskbody>
</task>
